Specification Record Filter Example 

Calculation Convert_F_to_C 
Description Converst Fahrenheit to Centigrade
Examples: FandC	
| F   | C   | Notes      |
| 32  | 0   | Freezing   |
| 212 | 100 | Boiling    |
| -40 | -40 | Below zero |
| 68  | 20  | Photo chem |


Attributes FandC
| Name  | Default | DataType | Notes |
| F     | 0       | Integer  |       |
| C     | 0       | Integer  |       |
| Notes |         | String   |       |

DomainTerm ID : IDForm
Description identifies a record

DataType IDForm
Description valid format for a record ID
Details ID must have exactly 5 letters and begin with Q # ListOfObject ValueValid
Examples: ValidValues
| Value  | IsValid | Notes             |
| Q1234  | true    |                   |
| Q123   | false   | Too short         |
| Q12345 | false   | Too long          |
| A1234  | false   | Must begin with Q |

Scenario Filter Data by ID
Given list of numbers : IDValue 
| ID    | Value |
| Q1234 | 1     |
| Q9999 | 2     |
| Q1234 | 3     |
When filtered by ID with value : IDForm
| Q1234 |
Then sum is : Integer 
| 4 |

Scenario Filter Data Another Way  
# filters data 
Given list of numbers : IDValue
| ID    | Value |
| Q1234 | 1     |
| Q9999 | 2     |
| Q1234 | 3     |
When filtered by: FilterValue Vertical
| Value | Q1234 |
Then result : ResultValue 
| Sum |
| 4   |

Scenario Add another value 
# filters data 
Given list of numbers : IDValue
| ID    | Value |
| Q1234 | 1     |
| Q9999 | 2     |
| Q1234 | 3     |
When element added: IDValue Vertical 
| ID    | Q1234 |
| Value | 4     |
When filtered by: FilterValue Vertical
| Value | Q1234 |
Then result : ResultValue 
| Sum |
| 8   |

Attributes FilterValue
| Name  | Default | DataType | Notes |
| Value | Q0000   | IDForm   |       |

Attributes ResultValue
| Name | Default | DataType | Notes |
| Sum  |         | Integer  |       |

Entity IDValue
| Name  | Default | DataType | Notes |
| ID    |         | IDForm   |       |
| Value | 0       | Integer  |       |



